# This repository is authored with LF endings and runs with core.autocrlf=true,
# so before this file a fresh checkout on Windows rewrote every tracked text
# file to CRLF. That is not cosmetic here: the migration suite asserts *byte*
# identity of the SQL under supabase_migrations/, and the Production release
# package is pinned by SHA256SUMS.txt. A CRLF checkout therefore failed 34
# migration-immutability assertions and every package hash against sources that
# were in fact unmodified — verified on commit 24556ad before this rule existed.
#
# Pin the checkout to LF everywhere so a fresh clone is byte-identical to the
# tree the gates and the hash inventory were recorded against, on any platform.
# No blob content changes: the index already stores LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Stated explicitly because it is hash-verified, not merely tested.
VAM_OS_PROD_S12_RELEASE_20260809/** text eol=lf

# Binary payloads must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
